gen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=taKCU2-WgWoQ7kNvwGf9657&_nc_oc=AdrrWgUIBk0C0HoA2SZ7ycNdX04HnQJi0gpMOPJo_jpQCIh8WGEa20bBH8r21lDutn4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRgNDjDFF8c6RGTpA3NXUEuehPUJ_-6kD-_lIpJfGUS2Q&oe=6AFDBE0B"}, "display_name": "Tube Be Continued", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Hello! Welcome to TUBE Industries: a hamster owned and operated tube puzzle emporium! \n\nPrepare for a tube-based, puzzle-filled, HAM-PACKED adventure with our charismatic leader: The BOSS. Here at TUBE Industries we provide the puzzles and you provide\u2026 the brains. No shady business here!\n\nTUBE-Based Benefits:\n\u2022 40 levels across 2 themed floors: Hamster Hangout & Smart Home Slide!\n\u2022 Customize your hamster\u2019s appearance!\n\u2022 Classic and slide-based tube puzzles!\n\u2022 Numerous Mini-Puzzles including our new hamster cannon!\n\u2022 Chat with the BOSS and help him deal with important \u201cbusiness decisions\u201d!\n\u2022 Relaxed-pace gameplay with no time pressure.\n\u2022 Supports seated, standing, or room scale play.\n\nYour destination for TUBE-Based entertainment awaits!\n\nSincerely,\nThe BOSS", "short_description": "Hello! Welcome to TUBE Industries: a hamster owned and operated tube puzzle emporium! \n\nPrepare for a tube-based, puzzle-filled, HAM-PACKED adventure with our charismatic leader: The BOSS. Here at TUBE Industries we provide the puzzles and you provide\u2026 the brains. No shady business here!\n\nSincerely,\nThe BOSS"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bluemonttechnology.com/game%20privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Bluemont Technology & Research, Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://tubebecontinued.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377